OL,3,GNEWSATown crier delighted to come 3rd
OL,4,Ain world contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town crier from Surrey has said he is
OL,7,F"delighted and a bit shocked" to finish
OL,8,Fthird in an international competition.
OL,10,FChristian Ashdown, who has cried for
OL,11,FHaslemere for 16 years, was the
OL,12,Fhighest-placed British entrant at the
OL,13,FWorld Town Crier Tournament in Chester.
OL,15,FThe tournament, which concluded on
OL,16,FSaturday, was won by Kevin Howarth from
OL,17,Fthe city of Toowoomba in Australia,
OL,18,Fwith Joris Goens of Veurne in Belgium
OL,19,Fplacing second.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
