OL,3,GNEWSATown crier delighted to come 3rd
OL,4,Ain world contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshdown told the BBC he was "quite
OL,7,Fsurprised" to finish as high as third
OL,8,Fas there were "big players" from
OL,9,Felsewhere in the world among the 25
OL,10,Fcriers taking part.
